   "source": [
    "# What is Apache Spark?\n",
    "Spark is a unified computing engine because it supports multiple workloads(Streaming, Batching, Analytics), and a distributed compute engine because it processes data in parallel across multiple cluster nodes(Group of Machines-Nodes)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "51a8772b-0a16-46cd-b2eb-d6f0bc07dd6e",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "# Why Apache Spark?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Monolithic:** Upgrade the system(Adding RAM, Cores) - Vertical Scaling(Adding more and more power to single computation machine)\n",
    "            Drawback: Limit of scaling the machine vertically, Availability(If Machine not works)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Distributed:** Add the systems(Add more machines(Nodes)) - Horizonal Scaling, High Availability(If one machine is not work, we have others to process)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "76dc03ca-7d7f-4e1e-bb55-bae89fdf7795",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "# Apache Spark vs MapReduce\n",
    "\n",
    "**MapReduce:** The Map phase is responsible for distributing the data across machines, and the Reduce phase gathers and aggregates the results from those machines.\n",
    "  **Drawback:** Intermediate results (joins, aggregations, etc.) are written to disk. Every time the system needs to read or fetch this data from disk for further processing, it takes additional time because of disk I/O operations.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Apache Spark:** It processes data mainly in memory, so there is no need to write intermediate results to disk. This makes processing much faster compared to MapReduce.\n",
    "  **Features:**\n",
    "  In-Memory Computation,\n",
    "  Lazy Evaluation,\n",
    "  Fault Tolerant,\n",
    "  Partitioning,\n",
    "  Streaming and Batch Processing using same API(Code)"
   ]
  },
  {
