   "source": [
    "# Cache and Persist\n",
    "### Cache: \n",
    "Cache only if you are using multiple times and don't cache bigger dataframes makesure your dataframe is small enough otherwise executor out of memory is waiting for you.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Cache.png)\n",
