     "nuid": "3b150d85-8aca-42ff-8f49-22085778a114",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Transformations.png)\n",
    "# Narrow Transformations\n",
    "A **Narrow Transformation** is a transformation where each partition of the parent RDD is used by only one partition of the child RDD.  \n",
    "This means data does **NOT** move across partitions (no shuffle).\n",
    "###### Characteristics\n",
    "- No data shuffling\n",
    "- Faster execution\n",
    "- Each child partition depends on only one parent partition\n",
    "###### Example Transformations\n",
    "- `map()`\n",
    "- `filter()`\n",
    "- `flatMap()`\n",
    "- `union()`\n",
    "###### Note: No data movement between nodes.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Narrow.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "#Wide Transformations\n",
    "A Wide Transformation is a transformation where multiple parent partitions contribute to one child partition. This requires data shuffling across nodes.\n",
    "\n",
    "###### Characteristics\n",
    "- Data shuffle happens\n",
    "- Slower than narrow transformations\n",
    "- Each child partition depends on multiple parent partitions\n",
    "#####Example Transformations\n",
    "- groupByKey()\n",
    "- reduceByKey()\n",
    "- join()\n",
    "- distinct()\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Wide.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
     "cellMetadata": {},
     "inputWidgets": {},
     "nuid": "8be5fb87-ed1d-461e-be6b-a61a82af736b",
     "showTitle": false,
     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "# Repartition Vs Coalesce\n",
    "| Feature           | `repartition()`                   | `coalesce()`                         |\n",
    "| ----------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n",
    "| Purpose           | Increase or decrease partitions   | Mostly used to decrease partitions   |\n",
    "| Shuffle           | **Yes (Full shuffle)**            | **No shuffle by default**            |\n",
    "| Performance       | Slower (due to shuffle)           | Faster                               |\n",
    "| Data distribution | Even distribution                 | May be uneven                        |\n",
    "| Use case          | When you want balanced partitions | When reducing partitions efficiently |\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Repartition.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Coalesce.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Repartition1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/RepartitionVsCoalesce.png)"
