   "source": [
    "## Driver Memory Management\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/DMM1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/DMM2.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/DMM3.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/DMM4.png)\n",
    "broadcast the variables which is greater than your driver size\n",
    "command like df.collect() - Collecting data from all executors and keeping in driver\n",
    "If run display, driver will few paritions(Full) from paritions and show(It won't bring full data) \n",
    "## Executor Memory Management\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EMM1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EMM2.png)\n",
