    "If run display, driver will few paritions(Full) from paritions and show(It won't bring full data) \n",
    "## Executor Memory Management\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EMM1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EMM2.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EMM3.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/EM1.png)\n",
