   "source": [
    "#RDD\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/RDD.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "RDDs are automatically split into partitions by Spark, but you can also control or change partitions manually if needed.\n",
    "Example: Coalesce, Repartition, Parallelize"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
