    "# Jobs, Stages and Tasks\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Jobs,Stages,Tasks%20Diagram.png)\n",
    "- Number of Actions = Number of Jobs\n",
    "- Whenever an action is executed, Spark creates a Job.\n",
    "- Each Job contains one or more Stages.\n",
    "- Each Stage contains multiple Tasks.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Jobs,Stages,Tasks.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "###### Key Note:\n",
    "- Action = Job\n",
    "- Shuffle(Each Wide Transformation) = New Stage\n",
    "- Narrow transformations = Same Stage\n",
    "- Tasks = Partitions"
   ]
