   "source": [
    "#### Joins Implementation\n",
    "##### Sort Merge Join\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/SM1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/SM2.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/SM3.png)\n",
    "##### Broadcast Join\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/BJ1.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/BJ2.png)\n",
