   "source": [
    "# Repartition Vs Coalesce\n",
    "| Feature           | `repartition()`                   | `coalesce()`                         |\n",
    "| ----------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n",
    "| Purpose           | Increase or decrease partitions   | Mostly used to decrease partitions   |\n",
    "| Shuffle           | **Yes (Full shuffle)**            | **No shuffle by default**            |\n",
    "| Performance       | Slower (due to shuffle)           | Faster                               |\n",
    "| Data distribution | Even distribution                 | May be uneven                        |\n",
    "| Use case          | When you want balanced partitions | When reducing partitions efficiently |\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Repartition.png)\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Coalesce.png)\n",
