     "tableResultSettingsMap": {},
     "title": ""
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Transformations.png)\n",
    "# Narrow Transformations\n",
    "A **Narrow Transformation** is a transformation where each partition of the parent RDD is used by only one partition of the child RDD.  \n",
    "This means data does **NOT** move across partitions (no shuffle).\n",
    "###### Characteristics\n",
    "- No data shuffling\n",
    "- Faster execution\n",
    "- Each child partition depends on only one parent partition\n",
    "###### Example Transformations\n",
    "- `map()`\n",
    "- `filter()`\n",
    "- `flatMap()`\n",
    "- `union()`\n",
    "###### Note: No data movement between nodes.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Narrow.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "#Wide Transformations\n",
    "A Wide Transformation is a transformation where multiple parent partitions contribute to one child partition. This requires data shuffling across nodes.\n",
    "\n",
    "###### Characteristics\n",
    "- Data shuffle happens\n",
    "- Slower than narrow transformations\n",
    "- Each child partition depends on multiple parent partitions\n",
    "#####Example Transformations\n",
    "- groupByKey()\n",
    "- reduceByKey()\n",
    "- join()\n",
    "- distinct()\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Wide.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "application/vnd.databricks.v1+cell": {
