    "## Dynamic Partition Pruning\n",
    "It's a magic.The magic is we know that our data is partitioned and if we apply any fiter on top of that, we get only selective partitions. Even if we don't apply any filter on our partitions, we still get the selective partitions is called Dynamic Partitions.\n",
