   "source": [
    "# Why Apache Spark?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Monolithic:** Upgrade the system(Adding RAM, Cores) - Vertical Scaling(Adding more and more power to single computation machine)\n",
    "            Drawback: Limit of scaling the machine vertically, Availability(If Machine not works)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Distributed:** Add the systems(Add more machines(Nodes)) - Horizonal Scaling, High Availability(If one machine is not work, we have others to process)"
   ]
  },
