   "source": [
    "##### Difference between Catalyst Optimizer and DAG and Tungsten\n",
    "    Catalyst decides what to run, the DAG Scheduler decides when and where to run it, and Tungsten decides how efficiently it runs on CPU and memory.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/Difference%20CvsDvsT.png)"
   ]
  }
