    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/QueryPlan.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "## DAG(Direct Acyclic Graph)\n",
    "It is a fundamental concept used by Spark’s execution engine to represent the flow of operations in a data processing job and to schedule the execution as jobs, stages, and tasks.\n",
    "![](Images/ApacheSpark/DAGFlow.png)"
